<section class="container py-5" style="max-width: 46rem;">
  <h1 class="h3 mb-3">Privacy</h1>
  <p>We collect only what we need to run your registration: your name, email, and
  the events you book. We use your email to send confirmations, receipts and
  event updates.</p>
  <p><strong>Payments.</strong> Card details are handled directly by Stripe and are
  never stored on our servers.</p>
  <p><strong>Sharing.</strong> We don't sell your data. Event organisers can see the
  roster for their own events (your name and registration status).</p>
  <p><strong>Your account.</strong> Guest checkout creates a minimal record tied to
  your email. You can activate a full account at any time to view your history.</p>
  <p class="text-secondary small mt-4">Questions? <a class="text-decoration-none" href="/contact">Contact us</a>.</p>
</section>
